The current path as cells
description: the idle_path state
- >
  No cell is focused. The cells spell the current node's path (indices folded - `pets[1]` is one
  cell), the root label first. The TOC is unfiltered and shows the normal selection. Every cell is
  click-to-edit - there is no separate view mode
- !!<*yamlover: $defs: table>
  header:
    - Event
      width: 2
    - 'Condition / note'
      width: 4
    - 'Next state'
      width: 2
  - ['`click_cell`', '', '[cell_editing](*::server:query-editor:cell_editing)']
  - ['`click_tail`', '', '[cell_editing](*::server:query-editor:cell_editing)']
  - ['`f4`', '', '[cell_editing](*::server:query-editor:cell_editing)']
  - ['`toc_click`', '', '`idle_path` (stays)']
